  "items": [
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Tomas Vondra 认为 random_page_cost 的默认值该改了",
      "summary": "random_page_cost 的默认值 4.0 来自机械硬盘年代，假定随机读比顺序读贵四倍。Tomas Vondra 在 POSETTE 演讲之后接着写道，SSD 与 NVMe 普及后随机 I/O 与顺序 I/O 的差距已经大幅缩小，这个默认值未必还合适。默认值偏高会让规划器系统性地低估索引扫描，做出更差的计划，他认为社区有必要重新评估并调整它。",
      "url": "https://vondra.me/posts/some-more-thoughts-on-random-page-cost/",
      "author": "Tomas Vondra",
      "source": "vondra.me",
      "source_date": "2026-06-23",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "参数",
        "优化器",
        "存储"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "CYBERTEC 发布备份恢复工具 pg_hardstorage",
      "summary": "CYBERTEC 发布 pg_hardstorage，一个 Apache 2.0 许可的 PostgreSQL 备份恢复工具。Hans-Jürgen Schönig 说它不打算取代 pgBackRest、Barman 或 WAL-G，而是面向 Kubernetes、托管云和混合基础设施这些新部署形态的社区驱动选项。设计上参考了复制协议，重新审视了传统增量备份链的固有问题。项目主页是 pghardstorage.org。",
      "url": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/introducing-pg_hardstorage-a-new-community-driven-approach-to-postgresql-backup-and-recovery/",
      "author": "Hans-Jürgen Schönig",
      "source": "CYBERTEC",
      "source_date": "2026-06-23",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "备份",
