    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "跨分片查询慢，多半不怪 enable_async_append",
      "summary": "enable_async_append 默认打开，决定规划器是否考虑异步 Append，对应计划里的 Async Foreign Scan 节点。它是 PostgreSQL 14 为 FDW 分片加的：跨多个远端服务器的分区表或 UNION ALL 查询可并发发请求，总耗时从各分片延迟之和变成最慢分片的延迟。但它还要外部服务器上的 async_capable 为真，而后者默认关闭。Christophe Pettus 建议生产上保持打开。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/all-your-gucs-in-a-row-enableasyncappend/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-06-23",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/2fd5bcba0b6c4cf0a43f646cee2c275f.png",
